+ jcs cleanup
+ lda #1
+ sta COUNT
+ lda se_v_top
+ ora se_v_top+1
+ ora se_v_top+2
+ beq :+
+ inc COUNT
+: lda #0
+ sta SLOT
+@validate:
+ jsr pointer
+ jsr record
+ jcs cleanup
+ lda SLOT
